A. Commit message:
s390/pci: Fix handling of isolated VFs in older version

B. Change summary:
This patch backports the fix for handling isolated VFs to the older version. It ensures that VFs whose parent PF is not configured are properly isolated by explicitly checking if the parent PF exists on the PCI domain determined by the topology ID or PCHID before registering the VF.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

